  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIWPS Partnership Georgetown Institute for Women, Peace and Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formalizing the partnership with Georgetown Institute for Women, Peace and Security (GIWPS), Norway has decided to fund two GIWPS research projects in 2016: A new Global Women, Peace and Security Index and a case study of women&apos;s role and rights in post conflict Colombia and Tunisia.</narrative>
  </description>
